    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7da69453218273172f5e8436",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今后要是在正式训练中好好煅炼的话，\n她所说的迪拜赛事也应该不会是遥远的梦想——",
      "source_fingerprint": "1aab261fcc99392e43b589423223c7bdb490d3f1989c4824e8810419f2499657",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
