      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "爸爸和妈妈，还有姐姐她们都非常温柔。\n让我尽情地撒娇……我非常喜欢他们。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b885919d9e6bddea17cb1e83d8a372b0efeba265ed4fafbe85f9db0846641b0",
